aac - AAC decoder using FAAD2
adplug - Bundled AdPlug player
alac - Bundled Apple Lossless decoder
alsa - ALSA output
ape - Bundled Monkey's Audio decoder
artwork - Album artwork loading
cdda - Audio CD playback and ripping
converter - File format converter
curl - HTTP streaming and network artwork fetching
dts - DTS audio decoder
dumb - Bundled DUMB module player
ffmpeg - FFmpeg audio decoder
flac - FLAC audio decoder
gme - Bundled Game Music Emu player
gtk2 - GTK 2 user interface
gtk3 - GTK 3 user interface
hotkeys - Global keyboard shortcuts
lastfm - last.fm and Libre.fm scrobbling
libretro - Libretro resampler
libsamplerate - Secret Rabbit Code resampler
lyrics - Lyrics viewer
m3u - M3U playlist support
medialib - Media library
mms - Bundled MMS streaming support
mono2stereo - Mono-to-stereo DSP
mp3 - MP3 decoder using mpg123
mpris - MPRIS D-Bus control
musepack - Musepack audio decoder
notify - Desktop notifications
nullout - Dummy output driver
opus - Opus audio decoder
oss - Open Sound System output
pipewire - PipeWire output
playlist-browser - Playlist browser
psf - Bundled PlayStation Sound Format player
pulseaudio - PulseAudio output
replaygain - ReplayGain scanner
sc68 - Bundled Atari ST and Amiga music player
shellexec - Custom shell commands for tracks
shorten - Bundled Shorten lossless audio decoder
sid - Bundled Commodore 64 SID player
sndfile - PCM audio support using libsndfile
soundtouch - Bundled SoundTouch DSP
supereq - SuperEQ equalizer
tta - Bundled True Audio decoder
vorbis - Ogg Vorbis audio decoder
vtx - Bundled VTX ZX Spectrum music player
wavpack - WavPack audio decoder
wildmidi - Bundled WildMIDI player
wma - Bundled WMA decoder
zip - ZIP archive reader
